{
  "id": "ss.enemy.courser",
  "name": "Courser",
  "description": "The caste that answers a Chorus. Everything else in the hive walks toward you; this one holds still, reads the air, and then commits the whole body along the line it read \u2014 so it is drawn as the only thing on the roster built to run, and the running is in the legs rather than the shell. A small hard body slung between three pairs of long bent legs that reach most of the way across the canvas, feelers out front. Every other creature here is a mass with limbs tucked under it \u2014 a Tracker is an ellipse, a Soldier is a dome, the Chorus is a disc, the Matriarch is a circle \u2014 so a wide leg span is the one silhouette the roster has left, it reads at any size, and it belongs to the body whose whole idea is speed. Crimson because nothing else in the hive is. Drawn facing +x, the game flips it. Gameplay radius 44.",
  "tags": ["ss-enemy", "boss"],
  "size": [112, 96],
  "meta": { "radius": 44 },
